return {
    ["        自从成为天使后，我能感受到自己人性的逐渐流失。\n        子民们就是我的锚，是他们的赞美让我不至于失控。整片大陆都在呼喊我的名字，特里尔远比以前宏伟热闹，但当我戴着王冠坐在王座上时，却只觉得厌倦……\n        从月亮上回来后，我终于看清了这个世界的疯狂与扭曲。哈哈哈哈，原来的我简直像个小丑，捧着一点机遇与成就就洋洋得意，自以为是时代的主角。但这一切都终将毁灭，我所创造的一切，所热爱的东西，这座城市，这个国家，这片大陆，甚至这个星球，终究……\n        只有成为真神，才能守护我想保护的东西。但无论是“窥秘人”还是“通识者”途径的成神之路都已经被堵死了。隔着遥远的时光，我突然理解那位“血皇帝”为什么会做出那样疯狂的选择，有机会可真想跟他喝上一杯。\n        我也是真的疯了，不是吗？"] = "Ever since I became an Angel, I have been able to feel the gradual loss of my humanity. \n The citizens are my anchors; it is their praise that keeps me from losing control. The entire continent is shouting my name, and Trier is far more magnificent and lively than before, but when I sit on the throne wearing the crown, I only feel weary... \n After returning from the moon, I finally saw the madness and distortion of this world. Hahahaha, the original me was just like a clown, holding onto a little opportunity and achievement, feeling smug and thinking I was the protagonist of the era. But all of this will eventually be destroyed; everything I created, everything I loved, this city, this country, this continent, even this planet, will eventually... \n Only by becoming a True God can I protect what I want to protect. But the paths to godhood for both the Mystery Pryer and Savant pathways have already been blocked. Across the distant time, I suddenly understand why that \"Blood Emperor\" would make such a crazy choice. If there were a chance, I would really like to have a drink with him. \n I am truly crazy too, aren't I?",
